&lt;div id=&quot;jobDescriptionTitle&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;jobDescriptionTitleHeading&quot; class=&quot;css-oiq21b e1tiznh50&quot;&gt;Full job description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;jobDescriptionText&quot; class=&quot;jobsearch-JobComponent-description css-1rybqxq eu4oa1w0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discover Rewarding Work as a CNA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in your neighborhood and give back to your community. BAYADA Home Health Care has an immediate need for a Certified Nursing Assistant to care for our clients. Check out our company below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$19-$23 an hour&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t forget to ask about our *$500 Referral Bonus**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a BAYADA CNA, you&#39;ll enjoy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Schedule for work/life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following a written plan of care by a registered nurse, you’ll provide personal care, household support, and companion care (homemaker) services to help adults stay safe and independent at home. As a BAYADA CNA, you’ll have the opportunity to develop close relationships with your clients while you help them with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activities of daily living: bathing, grooming, toileting, nail care, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Household support: light housekeeping, laundry, bed making etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal preparation and feeding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Range of motion/exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with ambulation (Transfers/use of mechanical lifting devices)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medication reminders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes you a great candidate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least one year of work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active CNA license registered with North Carolina in good standing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliant with Bayada policy needed for home care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you’ll love what you do at BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a mission-driven, not-for-profit organization, we are committed to providing patients the highest-quality care, enabling them to live at home with comfort, independence, and dignity. And we are just as dedicated to your satisfaction and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;89% of employees say they are proud to work for BAYADA!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Palm-Trillium-AVA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
